  <name>OpenTubeX</name>
  <summary>Privacy-focused YouTube client</summary>
  <description>
    <p>OpenTubeX is an open-source, highly customizable, privacy-focused YouTube
    client. Watch videos without ads or a Google account, with subscriptions,
    playlists and history stored on your device by default.</p>
    <p>Organize subscriptions into profiles, save playback preferences per
    channel, customize keyboard shortcuts, skip SponsorBlock segments, use
    DeArrow, open videos in tabs, build a queue and keep watching in the
    mini-player. Optional recommendations rank unwatched videos locally using
    your viewing activity and feedback.</p>
    <p>OpenTubeX uses a built-in extractor to request data and videos directly
    from YouTube, or you can use an Invidious API instead. It does not load the
    standard YouTube website or its page JavaScript; network services can still
    observe request metadata unless you use a proxy.</p>
  </description>
